{"3266790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bit by Bit", "steam_appid": 3266790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a ridiculous game with your friends in minutes</strong>, then jump in and play it together. Draw the weapons &amp; items, record the sound effects, draw the world, modify the rules and see what kind of cursed game your group creates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No artistic or game development experience required!!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW DOES IT WORK?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 1: Come up with crazy ideas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player answers some weird prompts to spark ideas. Your teammates will later bring your ideas to reality (but probably not in the way you imagined!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/9500878714fe73b6008bf0ea7be9e17c.avif?t=1786288405\" alt=\"shows a text input field where players must input ideas\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras_big/9500878714fe73b6008bf0ea7be9e17c.webp?t=1786288405 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 2: Unleash the creativity!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player receives their own creative challenges! The challenges are designed to be as simple and quick as possible. <strong>No artistic talent required!!</strong> Even your grandma should be able to complete them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/9346e4b351ddff4aea17e59e3071b392.webp?t=1786288405\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/9346e4b351ddff4aea17e59e3071b392.poster.avif?t=1786288405\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"shows different game-making tasks: sound recorder, texture editor, prop designer, player customizer\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 3: PLAYTEST!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the FPS game you just created together! Every texture, item, map, prop and sound effect was created by the players. Multiple game modes are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/118711af32a30ecf0af0bf7aaf4af19e.poster.avif?t=1786288405\" aria-label=\"shows gameplay of a game created by the players itself\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/118711af32a30ecf0af0bf7aaf4af19e.webm?t=1786288405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/118711af32a30ecf0af0bf7aaf4af19e.mp4?t=1786288405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 4: Add more features!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After one round of playing, every player gets to add a feature to your game. Want a new weapon? No problem. Want to nerf an overpowered item? Give it a dangerous side effect! Want to change the goal? Go for it! The choice is <span class=\"bb_strike\">yours</span> everyone's!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/eae4dd3a4477a2619c2d5b76b5226bfa.poster.avif?t=1786288405\" aria-label=\"shows a screen where every player chooses which feature to add to their game\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/eae4dd3a4477a2619c2d5b76b5226bfa.webm?t=1786288405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/eae4dd3a4477a2619c2d5b76b5226bfa.mp4?t=1786288405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 5</strong>: PLAYTEST AGAIN -&gt; VOTE AGAIN -&gt; ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique game loop makes your game get bigger, stranger and funnier every round. Keep creating &amp; playtesting to see how far the chaos can go. Who is the ultimate winner of your very ba<span class=\"bb_strike\">lance</span>d game?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own characters, items, props, sound effects, rules using simple interfaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No artistic or game development experience required!!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your friends in the FPS you just made</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote on new features each round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough creates a completely different game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reuse your favorite creations in future games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game modes: Survival, Prop Hunt, Free For All, Escape, Team Deadmatch ... or create your own!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a ridiculous game with your friends in minutes</strong>, then jump in and play it together. Draw the weapons &amp; items, record the sound effects, draw the world, modify the rules and see what kind of cursed game your group creates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No artistic or game development experience required!!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW DOES IT WORK?</h2><p clas