om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/118711af32a30ecf0af0bf7aaf4af19e.poster.avif?t=1786288405\" aria-label=\"shows gameplay of a game created by the players itself\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/118711af32a30ecf0af0bf7aaf4af19e.webm?t=1786288405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/118711af32a30ecf0af0bf7aaf4af19e.mp4?t=1786288405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 4: Add more features!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After one round of playing, every player gets to add a feature to your game. Want a new weapon? No problem. Want to nerf an overpowered item? Give it a dangerous side effect! Want to change the goal? Go for it! The choice is <span class=\"bb_strike\">yours</span> everyone's!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/eae4dd3a4477a2619c2d5b76b5226bfa.poster.avif?t=1786288405\" aria-label=\"shows a screen where every player chooses which feature to add to their game\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/eae4dd3a4477a2619c2d5b76b5226bfa.webm?t=1786288405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/extras/eae4dd3a4477a2619c2d5b76b5226bfa.mp4?t=1786288405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 5</strong>: PLAYTEST AGAIN -&gt; VOTE AGAIN -&gt; ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique game loop makes your game get bigger, stranger and funnier every round. Keep creating &amp; playtesting to see how far the chaos can go. Who is the ultimate winner of your very ba<span class=\"bb_strike\">lance</span>d game?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own characters, items, props, sound effects, rules using simple interfaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No artistic or game development experience required!!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your friends in the FPS you just made</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote on new features each round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough creates a completely different game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reuse your favorite creations in future games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game modes: Survival, Prop Hunt, Free For All, Escape, Team Deadmatch ... or create your own!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Build a ridiculous game with your friends in minutes, then jump in and play it together. Draw the weapons &amp; items, record the sound effects, draw the world, modify the rules and see what kind of cursed game your group creates.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/71318be90c1777200c02e30c66c4b3f8b31a65bb/header.jpg?t=1786288405", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/ea8a073060645cd1cf827ab44756eb2b254d0bbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786288405", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266790/ea8a073060645cd1cf827ab44756eb2b254d0bbf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786288405", "website": "https://stroopwafelgames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><stron